<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (With the support of Dr. Angela Parker who teaches the Domestic Violence class in the Sociology Department, Dr. Anna Muraco's Summer 2024 class partnered with the Jenesse Center for our engaged learning experience. Students in the class visited each of the Jenesse Center's community sites including emergency housing sites, the Emergency restraining order clinic in the Inglewood Courthouse, and the community outreach center in Leimert Park. For their final projects, students created informative social media posts for the Jenesse Center that integrated course materials, featured below.)
