500 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Could you please provide an update on your recent activities \(featured in Spring 2021 newsletter\)? )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
501 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I've become a research fellow at the UCSF Osher Center for Integrative Health. In addition to mentorship for my dissertation, teaching opportunities, and general professional development, I'm also on a mixed-methods applied research study that explores and evaluates integrative group medical visits and group acupuncture for people living with chronic pain with English and Spanish speaking cohorts. I produced my first evening-length immersive interdisciplinary production called "rosewater sundaze" that used my dance, music, film, research, herbalism, and social organizing skills. My family and I went to Barcelona for the World Parkinson's Congress, where my dad and I performed with an intergenerational dance company for people with Parkinson's Disease and we also presented a poster about our "Daddy Matters" dance, class series, and exhibition. I began dancing for a feminist aerial dance company called Flyaway productions and have toured with them nationally. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
502 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 220 0 R
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Could you please share a brief summary of your PhD dissertation? )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
504 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (My dissertation is an interpretive phenomenological study exploring healthcare decision-making for adolescents and young adults living with non-cancer serious illnesses while in pediatric palliative and/or hospice care. I am interviewing patients and providers, collecting observations at conferences and lectures, doing content analysis, and developing a "kinesthetic analysis" that integrates contemporary dance techniques for a more embodied approach.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
505 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (What current research or important projects are you working on? )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
506 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I'm co-author on a research article that just came out that reflects the telehealth version of the current study I'm on. That study \(also described above\) is on an integrative pain management program and we are currently in year 1 of the 3 year study. Since I joined, we have been using flexible coding and thematic analysis which has been fun and challenging. I just performed with Flyaway in If I Give You My Sorrows, which explores the experiences of currently and formerly incarcerated women and the video of it is on view at the Yerba Buena Center for the Arts in San Francisco through June as part of an immersive art exhibit. I'll be performing excerpts from that work this spring and we will begin rehearsing a new piece in the summer. I'm presenting at the California Arts and Culture Summit in April)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
507 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (What are your plans after completing your PhD? )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
508 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Vacation! Otherwise, I hope to keep doing what I'm doing. Applied research, interdisciplinary art, teaching, writing...I'm really happy with my current professional life and I basically just want more.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
